WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.210
It began in a cloud like this.

00:02.910 --> 00:05.294
Nobody saw the Solar System form.

00:05.744 --> 00:10.847
This trip is the story the evidence tells, shown over real places.

00:11.297 --> 00:20.487
It starts about four and a half billion years ago, in a dense cloud of gas and dust like this one in Orion, when part of it collapsed.
